        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pete Sell, Matt Serra, Ray Bronx Longo\n- Places: Garden City, New York, East Meadow, New York, Hempstead, Nassau County, New York, United States\n- Companies: TIAS.com\n- Roles: mixed martial artist, teacher, striking coach\n- Concepts: Brazilian Jiu Jitsu\n\nFacts:\n- TIAS.com was founded in 1995 and is based in Garden City, New York.\n- Pete Sell was born on August 5, 1982.\n- Pete Sell is an American mixed martial artist who specializes in Brazilian Jiu Jitsu.\n- Pete Sell is a black belt under teacher and fellow mixed martial artist Matt Serra in East Meadow, New York.\n- Pete Sell trained extensively under striking coach Ray Bronx Longo in Garden City, New York.\n- Garden City is an incorporated village in the town of Hempstead in central Nassau County, New York, in the United States.",
